g a sword, and uses a trained crow to help him gather information."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From BRS no Koibito"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1470"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/550ec6a59948224d42719dd9a85f5c02ce09234b3f9258dd30fe37f8ec5abe6b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3ebc59f6013f4800b128ea01bdeae32d2a90a6ef96ae8b6178e6a40c852db348.webp","width":150,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"皆川 純子","creatorId":"vndb:s948","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s948","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s948","name":"皆川純子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:41118","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1477","characterName":"藤堂 平助","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1477"},"originalCharacterName":"藤堂 平助","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"From his sheltered childhood Todou can appear naïve and will often spring into a situation without thinking. Hates to be treated like a child, but looks up to Nagakura as a big brother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From BRS no Koibito"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1477"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c416e4648ed60d63c278a4665a2d8731ebe08996b7a0d12a3feaee6e8fa358a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d4a8842f8a36e66bd13d691a49bff390676cb8f7d767aed0756cd05b050fdf6.webp","width":149,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松野 太紀","creatorId":"vndb:s4706","sourcePerso